      "side": 1,
      "message": "The I2C address is not required, because `tcpci_tcpm_usb_mux_driver` use `mux_write()/mux_read()` functions. As long as an `struct usb_mux` has not a `USB_MUX_FLAG_NOT_TCPC` in its flags, the I2C address from the `tcpc_config` is used to access mux registers. In that case, `struct usb_mux` `i2c_port` and `i2c_addr_flags` are never used.",
      "parentUuid": "c55bd00b_91a5e334",
      "revId": "a5405fca324ed9efd3be868cb56319a1112a1fa1",
