      "writtenOn": "2022-04-22T00:05:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Regarding the JHL8040R driver, this DTS node for this device is currently put directly on the I2C bus.  However this node is processed by config_chip.h to extract only a couple properties to set the legacy CONFIG_ options.\n\nThis drive should be moved from the I2C bus, and instead should be defined like the other muxes.  The JHL8040R just requires a couple extra properties to specify the required GPIOs.",
      "parentUuid": "a376bfc7_ffce323a",
      "revId": "a5405fca324ed9efd3be868cb56319a1112a1fa1",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
